</listitem><listitem><para><bold><ref refid="group__sl__bt__connection__tx__power__const_1gac9f8c677a74eeba96ff3314126676696" kindref="member">SL_BT_CONNECTION_TX_POWER_UNAVAILABLE</ref> (0x7F):</bold> Transmit power level is not available. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
